Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:01.77,TL,,0,0,0,,大满贯男单半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:05.09,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}149{\fs68}年来 首次没有单反
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:15.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The big winner from Stan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦林卡 一记大力制胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.39,0:00:18.05,TL,,0,0,0,,这一记单反直线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:21.03,TL,,0,0,0,,让瓦林卡拿下{\fs78}2015{\fs68}年法网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:22.23,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}27{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:25.27,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}41{\fs68}岁的他在巴塞尔退役了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:28.56,TL,,0,0,0,,可就在今年 四大满贯男单半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:31.19,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}16{\fs68}个席位 没有一个单反
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:31.98,TL,,0,0,0,,据统计
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:34.21,TL,,0,0,0,,这是{\fs78}1877{\fs68}年第一届温网以来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:35.43,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.69,0:00:40.00,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1973{\fs68}年 {\fs78}ATP{\fs68} 公布第一份排名
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:42.02,TL,,0,0,0,,前{\fs78}10{\fs68}名里{\fs78}9{\fs68}个人打单反
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:44.68,TL,,0,0,0,,唯一的例外 是康纳斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:49.36,TL,,0,0,0,,单反好看 一只手把整个身体甩出去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:51.27,TL,,0,0,0,,打得平 打得狠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.27,0:00:52.95,TL,,0,0,0,,瓦林卡就靠这一拍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.95,0:00:55.35,TL,,0,0,0,,抢下了{\fs78}3{\fs68}座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.64,0:01:10.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That one simply didn't deviate from its path for one second, that was very well struck.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一拍没偏一点 打得真扎实
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:15.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well this goes straight into the portfolio of astonishing backhands from Roger Federer.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N收进费德勒的神级反手集
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.09,0:01:18.29,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}50{\fs68}年后 {\fs78}2024{\fs68}年{\fs78}2{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.29,0:01:20.32,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯跌出前{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.32,0:01:21.37,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}ATP{\fs68} 前{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.37,0:01:23.74,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次一个单反都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.09,0:01:27.82,TL,,0,0,0,,单反 为什么越来越少？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:30.50,TL,,0,0,0,,第一 怕高球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:32.68,TL,,0,0,0,,弹到肩膀那么高的上旋球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:34.55,TL,,0,0,0,,一只手很难发力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:35.89,TL,,0,0,0,,纳达尔对费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:37.12,TL,,0,0,0,,用的就是这一招
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.12,0:01:39.80,TL,,0,0,0,,一拍一拍压向他的反手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.89,0:01:44.57,TL,,0,0,0,,第二 来不及
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.57,0:01:47.53,TL,,0,0,0,,谢尔顿这一发 时速{\fs78}208{\fs68}公里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.53,0:01:49.42,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯单手伸出去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:51.41,TL,,0,0,0,,只能把球挡回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.59,0:01:55.18,TL,,0,0,0,,第三 从小学的就是双反
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:01:56.17,TL,,0,0,0,,费德勒说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:01:58.74,TL,,0,0,0,,现在大多数教练自己就是双反
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.74,0:02:01.51,TL,,0,0,0,,而且教孩子双反 要容易得多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:02.93,TL,,0,0,0,,他自己的一个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.93,0:02:04.87,TL,,0,0,0,,正在从双反改成单反
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.87,0:02:07.39,TL,,0,0,0,,正在体会这有多难
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:10.01,TL,,0,0,0,,最后的单反
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:13.61,TL,,0,0,0,,男子大满贯最后一个单反冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:16.04,TL,,0,0,0,,是{\fs78}2020{\fs68}年美网的蒂姆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:17.71,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛他先丢两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.71,0:02:19.77,TL,,0,0,0,,逆转了兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:21.42,TL,,0,0,0,,今年美网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:24.61,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯是签表里剩到最后的单反
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.61,0:02:26.05,TL,,0,0,0,,第四轮对谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.05,0:02:28.01,TL,,0,0,0,,他一个破发点都没拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.01,0:02:30.13,TL,,0,0,0,,直落{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:38.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Double match point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N双赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:48.64,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That was some high octane hitting.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真是火力全开的对攻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:50.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It really was.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N确实如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.49,0:02:52.84,TL,,0,0,0,,费德勒说 单反不会消失
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:54.27,TL,,0,0,0,,它还会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.27,0:02:56.24,TL,,0,0,0,,瓦林卡走了 你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:58.36,TL,,0,0,0,,还有人打单反吗？
